  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let f&#xF6;r insatsen &#xE4;r att under en tre&#xE5;rsperiod ge Baltic University Programme stabila verksamhetsvillkor, vilket skall ge goda f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;tt- ningar f&#xF6;r att forts&#xE4;tta med p&#xE5;g&#xE5;ende kurser samt att utveckla nya kursmoduler. Styrelsen f&#xF6;r programmet best&#xE5;r av representanter fr&#xE5;n universitet i 14 olika l&#xE4;nder. 3000 stud/&#xE5;r f&#xF6;rv&#xE4;ntas delta i kurserna</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to support the Baltic University Programme&apos;sactivities, which will give possibilities to continue ongoing pro- grammes and to develop new programme modules. The committee of the programme consists of representatives from universities in 14 different countries. 3000 stud./year will take part in the programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
